      "sample-baker/sourdough-chart": {
        "README.md": "# Sourdough chart\n\nAn interactive chart of bulk fermentation times by dough temperature.\n\n## Usage\n\n    npx sourdough-chart --flour wheat --units c\n\n| Flag | What it does |\n|---|---|\n| `--flour` | wheat, rye or spelt |\n| `--units` | c or f |\n| `--starter` | starter percentage (default 20) |\n\nSource is in `src/`: `curves.js` holds the data, `chart.js` draws it.\n",
        "src/cli.js": "import { parseArgs } from 'node:util';\n\nexport const options = {\n  flour: { type: 'string', default: 'wheat' },\n  units: { type: 'string', default: 'c' },\n  levain: { type: 'string', default: '20' },\n  dark: { type: 'boolean', default: false },\n};\n\nexport const args = parseArgs({ options }).values;\n",
        "src/curves.js": "export const curves = {\n  wheat: [[18, 9], [21, 6.5], [24, 5], [27, 4]],\n  spelt: [[18, 8], [21, 6], [24, 4.5], [27, 3.5]],\n};\n",
        "src/chart.js": "// Draws the chart with d3.\nimport * as d3 from 'd3';\n",
        "package.json": "{\n  \"name\": \"sourdough-chart\",\n  \"version\": \"1.4.0\",\n  \"dependencies\": { \"d3\": \"^7.9.0\" }\n}\n"
      },
      "sample-baker/oven-timer": {
        "README.md": "# Oven timer\n\nA Home Assistant card that counts down each stage of a bake.\n",
        "custom_components/oven_timer/__init__.py": "\"\"\"Oven timer.\"\"\"\nDOMAIN = 'oven_timer'\n"
      }
